profile: tinyrustlm-mirust.architecture.current.v1
updated_utc: 2026-08-28T20:20:00Z
site: TinyRustLM.MiRust.com

site_architecture:
  rendering: Plain PHP routes, native HTML/CSS, and bounded vanilla JavaScript.
  current_content: data/pages.php, README.md, llms.txt, llms-full.txt, and current docs.
  public_uai: Allowlisted orientation and pointer files only.
  historical_evidence: docs/reports and docs/runtime-portal are labeled non-authoritative archives.
  release: Content-addressed committed bytes, deterministic manifest, bounded deployment, and exact HTTPS readback.

product_architecture:
  - One clean-slate prelaunch browser-local TinyRustLM.com product.
  - One exact six-member SLM2 composition path with independent validation.
  - One dedicated worker owns model, tokenizer, generation, and KV state.
  - Project sites receive no prompts or model bytes.

memory_authority: Read .uai/totem.uai and .uai/taboo.uai for the exact two separate MemoryEndpoints.com uses and prelaunch redundancy rules.
